WEBVTT

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:35.980
The Light of Creation

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:36.130
We've both changed a lot.

00:01:36.720 --> 00:01:41.050
We're Sho who wield our own 
Hayagami in this world.

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:42.950
All in a fight for submission.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.750
A fight for submission? You're wrong!

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.670
I'm not wrong.

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:54.630
Nothing between us has 
changed since then.

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:03.140
Arata...

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.770
Just say it, Hinohara.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:09.460
You hate my guts, don't you?

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.690
You want to kill me so bad you 
can't stand it, don't you?

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.360
So bad, you became a demon!

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.340
What's wrong? Go ahead!

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:24.700
Become a demon and fight me for real!

00:02:25.820 --> 00:02:29.710
I... I won't become a demon!

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.710
I'll change your heart!

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:41.780
You just don't get it.

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:45.220
My heart only yields to power.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.310
That's why I'm telling you to fight me.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.230
Hinohara! Fight me!

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.240
His Hayagami evolved?!

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:04.070
Orochi is excited.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.760
Hinohara...

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:20.980
Kadowaki...

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.530
Hinohara!

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.240
Arata!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:56.440
I told you, you're not 
getting away, Hinohara!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.040
It has begun.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:06.740
The Hayagami at the root of
 all creation, Tsukuyo,

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:11.560
and the one Hayagami that 
can defeat it, Orochi.

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:13.150
Light and darkness...

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:18.610
Let us enjoy this battle 
between the two Hayagami.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:23.470
<i>Arata...</i>

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:38.210
I've been waiting for this fight.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.500
I'm going to enjoy every moment.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.380
What's his problem?

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.540
What did Arata do to him?!

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:51.130
<i>Every day, Kadowaki and his buddies</i>

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:53.580
<i>pushed me around with no resistance.</i>

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:59.270
<i>At school, I was forced 
to submit all the time.</i>

00:05:00.370 --> 00:05:01.250
Arata...

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.490
Lord Kannagi! Help Arata!

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.720
This is his fight.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.230
We can do nothing but watch.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.020
Kanate...

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:20.280
Lord Kannagi is right.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:25.500
Besides, if I tried to help, 
I'd only be a hindrance.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:26.950
I hate to admit it...

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.040
Don't worry.

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.210
Arata won't become a demon.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:34.840
He won't lose.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.870
I believe in him.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.910
You believe in him, too, right?

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.800
Believe in Arata...

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.490
<i>Arata...</i>

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.920
Hinohara!

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.420
Appear!

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:10.380
Are you going to shut 
yourself in again?!

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.940
Attack me!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.350
This is not a game! 
It's a fight for submission!

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.920
Make you submit?

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:18.920
I can't...

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:22.610
I can't do that!

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.340
Fight, Arata!

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:26.050
You're gonna get killed if you don't!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.490
Then you'll never make 
it to the princess!

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:32.770
<i>That's right.</i>

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:38.030
<i>I want to live up to the trust 
that the princess had in me.</i>

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.920
<i>But what do I do?</i>

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.210
Arata!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:46.820
You won't lose, Arata! 
I know you won't!

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.970
I... No...

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.090
We all believe in you!

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:06.090
Believe? None of you even have a clue!

00:07:06.090 --> 00:07:10.160
I'll make you regret 
believing in Hinohara!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.060
Lord Yorunami!

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:15.300
We mustn't.

00:07:15.300 --> 00:07:17.360
We have to believe in Arata the Sho.

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:28.420
Master Kadowaki...

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:37.540
Not bad. He may manage to take 
down Tsukuyo with him.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.030
No...

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.290
The boy called Kadowaki

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:45.190
may well surpass our expectations.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.960
Arata! Shake it off!

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.460
It's no use, I can't deflect it.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:56.830
Orochi's Kamui is too strong.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.070
No!

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.600
Damn it!

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:00.640
He's in trouble.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.860
Yes. Since Tsukuyo does not 
possess offensive Kamui,

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:07.560
it can do nothing if he cannot 
nullify Orochi's Kamui.

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:15.510
Everyone...

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.660
You have served me well.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:20.020
Thank you.

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.810
I will submit to Arata the Sho.

00:08:28.300 --> 00:08:30.850
Y-You mustn't, Lord Yorunami!

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:34.960
You are our wise leader, 
and one of the Twelve Shinsho!

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:38.010
I will entrust everything 
to Arata the Sho.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:42.360
I know this is an act far more 
noble than becoming king,

00:08:43.110 --> 00:08:47.250
and one that will earn 
my mother's praise.

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:54.680
Wait, Yorunami! What are you saying?!

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:59.220
Live on, Arata the Sho.

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:03.660
I wish to see the world 
under your reign.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:07.750
You...

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:08.990
It's all right.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:12.450
I will support Arata the 
Sho through Tsukuyo

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:16.110
and see through his battle.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:18.070
Yorunami...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.950
Now this is interesting.

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:29.300
Stop, Yorunami!

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:32.130
I don't want to have you submit to me.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.680
I don't...

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:34.670
Are you running away?!

00:09:35.610 --> 00:09:37.410
Aren't you going to change the world?!

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.810
Then accept this test 
and don't run away!

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.560
Test?

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:46.830
To submit to another is not 
to to be killed or sacrificed.

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.540
It is leaving one's life 
force in your hands,

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.620
like Tsutsuga once did.

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:55.730
Carry their life force, their feelings, 
and their wishes with you,

00:09:55.730 --> 00:09:57.940
and continue to move forward 
as long as your life lasts!

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:01.600
Find your resolve and have Yorunami submit!

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.330
Then move forward for the sake 
of all those who believe in you!

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:10.250
Those who believe in me...

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:12.800
Hayagami Nakisawa,

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.650
submit now to the great Sho before me.

00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:22.680
My life shall be as one 
with the great Hayagami.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:11:00.050
Yorunami!

00:11:19.910 --> 00:11:22.010
Be strong, Master Shiotsuchi.

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:24.260
Th-Thank you.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:29.520
Lord Yorunami's palace...

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.360
Are you okay, Kotoha-chan?

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:36.790
Kanate...

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:38.770
Where's Arata?

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:39.770
Over there.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:11:59.450
Yorunami...

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:02.130
Hinohara.

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:06.870
Never thought I'd see you 
make him submit.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.620
I guess you're finally 
taking this seriously.

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:12.530
Kadowaki...

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:15.510
Why are you so determined to fight me?

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:17.800
Why?

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:23.010
<i>Hinohara!</i>

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.560
<i>Did you reduce your speed on purpose?!</i>

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.030
<i>Are you pitying me?!</i>

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:27.980
<i>What?</i>

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:31.890
<i>Don't you make fun of me!</i>

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:35.030
I want to beat you.

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:37.920
No one else. Only you.

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:39.720
Beat me?

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.780
When did you lose to me?

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:43.760
You're the one who's always

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.920
tormented me so you
 could stand on top!

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:50.790
You really don't understand anything.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.580
So I have no choice but to fight you.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:02.050
Show me what you can really do!

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.320
Appear, Nakisawa!

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:21.150
I guess bluffing won't work.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.950
That's it. That's the look I wanted.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.470
<i>There are things you can only 
see after you've lost them.</i>

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:49.090
<i>I once lost everything.</i>

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.710
<i>It was only when I realized</i>

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:56.640
<i>I had nothing more to lose 
that I gained my power.</i>

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.980
<i>I understand, Akachi.</i>

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.900
<i>I will obtain power.</i>

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:06.320
<i>I'll throw away everything</i>

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.650
<i>if it'll let me defeat him.</i>

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:16.000
Watch my fight with 
this eye you gave me!

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:17.790
Akachi!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.290
Akachi?! He has Akachi's eye?!

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:27.490
Akachi, what did you do to him?

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.500
Let's settle this, Hinohara.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.330
Hayagami Orochi!

00:15:01.930 --> 00:15:03.630
Hayagami Tsukuyo!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.300
Appear!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.600
I want to live up to 
all of their trust.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:21.020
My fight isn't just my own anymore!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:37.220
Kadowaki, you cannot make me submit!

00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:46.450
Tsukuyo's glow...

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.470
What's going on?

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:03.850
This is...

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.950
What is this?

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.920
Is this Tsukuyo's...

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.360
Arata's power?

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.300
Arata...

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:38.060
Hinohara, you...

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:42.220
For my friends, for the lives that 
have submitted to Tsukuyo...

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:45.290
For all the people who believe in me...

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.980
For the sake of changing this world...

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:49.360
I will...

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.450
That light... It couldn't be...

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:04.380
Sousei-no-Hinowa!

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:08.030
Arata has awakened Tsukuyo completely!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:14.890
Wow, Arata looks like a king.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:22.560
I will not yield to anything or anyone!

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:34.610
You're fighting to change the world?

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:39.280
Then I'll fight for me and me alone!

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:43.950
Prepare yourself, Hinohara.

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:45.460
I will...

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.960
I will make you submit!

00:17:48.860 --> 00:17:50.150
Bring it anytime.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.860
I won't run away anymore.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:58.300
Don't forget you said that.

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:08.830
He won.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.510
Arata...

00:18:12.220 --> 00:18:15.530
Please land the ship! 
Save Master Kadowaki!

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:21.940
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:25.400
<i>It was supposed to be a fight 
to the death for submission,</i>

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:26.830
<i>but it's like...</i>

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:30.730
<i>When I run with you, 
I feel like the wind.</i>

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:34.470
<i>So keep running with your eyes forward.</i>

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.230
<i>I'll keep running beside you.</i>

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:40.500
<i>Run with all your strength, Hinohara.</i>

00:18:41.960 --> 00:18:43.020
<i>Kadowaki...</i>

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:01.450
Thank you, Tsukuyo.

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:04.280
You believe in me, too, don't you?

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:06.450
Arata!

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:07.590
Kotoha!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.240
Grab on!

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.460
Arata!

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:16.170
Thank goodness...

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.910
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:20.650
Kotoha...

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:22.490
Oh, right...

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:29.190
I bought this in Suzukura,

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:31.870
but I haven't had a chance 
to give it to you.

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:33.780
Arata...

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.310
I love it. Thank you.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.740
I'm going forward.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.020
Come with me, Kotoha.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:53.800
Yes.

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:58.490
Are you sure about this?

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:02.970
We Zokusho are of one body 
and soul with Lord Yorunami.

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:05.670
Along with Lord Yorunami,

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:09.180
we will lend our strength to 
protect you, Arata the Sho.

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:14.000
We place our life force in your 
hands along with our trust, Arata.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:21.820
Our lives shall be as one 
with the great Hayagami.

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:37.720
K-Kadowaki...

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.890
He switched places with 
one of the Six Sho?

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:43.300
Yeah. Be careful.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:44.810
I will.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.380
But, still...

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:48.220
What?

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:50.870
You've changed somehow.

00:20:51.970 --> 00:20:54.850
You seem stronger.

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:56.990
Yeah.

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:03.050
I never expected to 
see Sousei-no-Hinowa.

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:05.660
We need to get rid of him.

00:21:05.660 --> 00:21:09.570
Yes. To realize our true desire...

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:11.580
Yes...

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:16.170
Hayagami Tsukuyo will fall, 
and the world will change.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:21.320
I will wait in this world 
until I get to see that day.

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:25.250
I can't believe he made Yorunami submit.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:32.260
Come to me now. I will make 
you submit, Arata the Sho.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:36.430
Why is the princess still alive?

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:37.910
Why?!

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:42.660
<i>Emisu...</i>

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.820
<i>I will reclaim Homura 
if it costs my life.</i>

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:50.000
<i>Then, I will make Akachi submit 
with my own hands.</i>

00:21:55.420 --> 00:22:01.410
How long before I can sleep without 
the torment of nightmares?

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:06.540
Emisu...

00:22:11.270 --> 00:22:14.260
I'm glad you're safe, Master Kadowaki.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:17.960
Hinohara is really something.

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:21.730
That's why I acknowledged 
him once before.

00:22:22.630 --> 00:22:25.960
But that's also why 
I can't forgive him.

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:27.840
I can't lose to him.

00:22:28.940 --> 00:22:30.950
I don't care if it's 
just my stupid pride.

00:22:31.430 --> 00:22:34.830
I have to surpass him.

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:39.830
Master Kadowaki, you really do 
care about Master Hinohara.

00:22:40.320 --> 00:22:41.270
Shut up.

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:50.980
Let's fight for submission again, 
with all our strength,

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:53.100
Hinohara.

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:12.450
I will change this world, 
Kadowaki's heart,

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:14.220
and myself!

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:26.180
<i>Arata, show me your all-seeing 
eyes, your open heart,</i>

00:23:26.180 --> 00:23:28.250
<i>and your strong will.</i>

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:30.480
<i>I will be waiting,</i>

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:34.140
<i>believing in you.</i>
